title: "Perf Sentinel Hub: finding history and aggregation for Perf Sentinel"
abstract: "Perf Sentinel Hub keeps the history of the findings Perf Sentinel daemons produce, aggregates them across sources, and launches an analysis from the browser. A .NET NativeAOT service backed by SQLite."
